# Read by matplotlib from the working directory, so every figure command run
# from the repository root picks it up. A fixed hash salt makes SVG clip-path
# and gradient ids deterministic instead of drawn from a random uuid, which is
# what lets an unchanged figure produce an unchanged .svg byte for byte.
# Pair with SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=0 (set by scripts/run_all_figures.py) to also
# freeze the embedded PDF/SVG dates.
svg.hashsalt: coping-dynamics-sequencing
